  "description": "Connects the OASIS to GOMap -- a geo-location and augmented reality mapping engine providing the spatial layer for placing OASIS entities on real-world maps and AR overlays. Powers the Our World and One World geo-spatial visualisation layers. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
